  "approach": "Implement a CSV export button in the activity log header that captures the current filtered dataset and generates a downloadable CSV file with proper formatting. The button will be conditionally enabled/disabled based on the log's content state, and the export will respect all active filters including the date-range filter at the moment of export.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
